{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在部分段落压缩了心理因果和前后转变的铺垫，例如S08主动回应的信心从何而来、S13为什么从害怕添负担转为害怕失去，X交代得更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用重点加亮让观众很快抓住每段心理变化的核心，短句与感受交替也形成了明确的阅读节奏，按音乐出现的感受尤其能让人边听边对照。它对音色、声部、力度、节奏和身体感受的描述更具体，情绪层次也更丰富。X的优势是心理动机交代充分，人物从小心试探到坦然表达、再到接受不确定性的过程衔接得更完整；但综合边听边扫屏幕的即时体验，我更选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a8b4d612-2810-4d17-afc4-b935f389e6fb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T231959128775Z", "elapsed_seconds": 55.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T23:20:54.352686+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "64a96799154dc93b359b96d5d2c944d7ebb8b6c4bf55d8a8bfda5996887a8b61", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_att